/-!
# Local sections of internal Hom complexes, and the evaluation morphism, on a ringed site

This file only re-exports its parts:

* `LocalSectionAction`: the action of a local section of an internal Hom complex on a local
  section of its source, and the specification `EvaluationConstruction` of evaluation
  morphisms.
* `EvaluationSection`: the evaluation section of a homogeneous pure tensor and its
  compatibility with restriction, the module structures and the differentials.
* `EvaluationMorphism`: the canonical evaluation morphism of Stacks 0A92 and its naturality.
-/
